/-!
# FS–FLTZ geometric theorem and foundations

Concrete toric inputs, quotient formulas, analytic bounds and rounding data,
pointwise symplectic algebra, smooth quotient geometry, Liouville completions,
finite graded comparison chains, and the geometric theorem specified by
`geoemtric-part-fsf.tex`.

`FsFltz.geometricTarget : FsFltz.GeometricTarget` proves the geometric target.
The construction preserves all admissible-choice quantifiers, literal full
endpoint core equality, and the prescribed grading on the same fourteen-arrow
chain. The general categorical GPS deduction remains an external interface.
See `phase-ii-progress.md` for verification evidence and source adaptations.
-/
